# ⚔️ KothPlugin — King of the Hill for Paper 1.21.4

A production-quality **King of the Hill** plugin built for Paper 1.21.4. Fully GUI-driven with a custom wand-based zone selector, score system, daily schedules, Discord alerts, and per-arena reward commands.

---

## ✨ Features

- **Score-based capture** — 1 point per second, 180 points to win (3 minutes). Fully configurable.
- **Contested zones** — timer pauses when multiple players are in the zone.
- **Custom wand** — set zone corners with a stick. No WorldEdit required.
- **Full 54-slot GUI** — create, manage and monitor all arenas in-game.
- **Daily schedules** — set multiple auto-start times per arena (HH:MM:SS). Built-in time picker GUI.
- **Discord webhooks** — violation and win alerts sent to your Discord channel.
- **Reward commands** — run any console command on win with `%player%` support.
- **Live chat announcements** — colour-coded broadcasts for every game event.
- **Player disconnect handling** — clears control if the capper logs off mid-game.

