## 🕹️ Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `/koth` | Open the management GUI |
| `/koth list` | List all arenas and their status |
| `/koth start <arena>` | Force-start a specific arena |
| `/koth start` | Start all enabled arenas |
| `/koth end <arena>` | Force-stop a specific arena |
| `/koth end` | Stop all running arenas |
| `/koth when <arena>` | Show schedule times for an arena |
| `/koth when` | Show schedule times for all arenas |
| `/koth wand <arena>` | Get the zone wand for an arena |

