## 🪄 Zone Wand

The wand is a **stick** with a custom name and persistent data tag so it won't conflict with regular sticks.

1. Run `/koth wand <arena>` — the wand is added to your inventory.
2. **Right-click** any block to set **Pos1** (first corner).
3. **Left-click** any block to set **Pos2** (second corner).
4. Once both positions are set, the zone saves **automatically**.
5. Drop or replace the wand when done. You can re-run `/koth wand` at any time to refine the selection.

> Particle effects appear at each corner when set, so you can see exactly where your zone is.

