## 🖥️ GUI Overview

### Main Menu `/koth`
Lists all arenas as icons. Green = enabled, beacon = live, coal = disabled. Click any arena to manage it.

### Arena Settings
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| 🪄 Get Zone Wand | Gives you the wand to set the zone |
| Toggle Enabled | Enable/disable auto-restart and schedules |
| ⏱ Score To Win | Adjust win score (+/-10, +/-50) |
| ▶ Start Game | Force-start the arena |
| ■ Stop Game | Force-stop the arena |
| 🎁 Rewards | Manage win reward commands |
| 📅 Schedules | Manage daily auto-start times |
| ✈ Teleport | Teleport to the zone centre |
| 🗑 Delete | Shift+click to permanently delete |

### Schedules GUI
Add daily auto-start times via chat (`14:30:00`) or using the built-in **time picker** with `+`/`-` buttons for hours, minutes and seconds. Click any existing schedule to remove it.

### Rewards GUI
Add console commands run on win. Use `%player%` as a placeholder for the winner's name. A **Default Rewards** button applies the three standard key rewards instantly.

