## ⚙️ Configuration

`config.yml` is managed automatically via the GUI. You can edit it manually if needed.

```yaml
settings:
  prefix: "&6&lKOTH &8» &r"
  check-interval: 20  # ticks between zone checks (20 = 1 second)

arenas:
  my_koth:
    enabled: true
    capture-score: 180       # points needed to win
    rewards:
      - "koth givekey %player% nexora 1"
    schedules:
      - "14:00:00"
      - "20:00:00"
    world: world
    min-x: 100
    min-y: 64
    min-z: 100
    max-x: 120
    max-y: 80
    max-z: 120
```

